From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Project Luma <engineering@projectluma.org>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 12:00:29 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] LumaUI Settings: Turn off TV Mode on the TV's Display page

In TV posture the Display page opens with a TV Mode row whose Turn Off
button calls the shell state's SetPosture ("automatic"), the call Quick
Options' mode picker and the TV quick panel make, so the saved
presentation returns as it was. A failed call shows a toast. Test:
/settings/view/tv-leave answers SetPosture from a stand-in shell state.
---
 shell/cc-luma-view-displays.c |  1 +
 shell/cc-luma-view-private.h  |  1 +
 shell/cc-luma-view-tv.c       | 39 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 shell/test-luma-view.c        | 59 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 100 insertions(+)

